@* V1009_BASELINE_ENTRY_GUIDE *@
<section class="baseline-entry-guide" aria-labelledby="baseline-entry-title">
    <span class="client-start-kicker">START WITH REAL DATA</span>
    <h3 id="baseline-entry-title">A useful baseline is better than a perfect guess</h3>
    <p>
        Enter your current information as accurately as practical. Weight,
        body-composition readings, normal activity, sleep, training experience,
        and realistic workout availability help Recomp establish its starting
        point. You can update these values later as better information becomes
        available.
    </p>
    <p>
        For ongoing scale entries, similar morning conditions improve
        comparability. Do not change a number because you think it is what the
        system wants to see - honest data gives the system better evidence.
    </p>
</section>